      "text": "cnt = 0\nfor s in open('9.csv'):\n    M = [int(x) for x in s.split(';')]\n    copied = [x for x in M if M.count(x) == 2]\n    not_copied = [x for x in M if M.count(x) == 1]\n    if len(copied) == 4 and len(not_copied) == 2:\n        if sum(copied) < sum(not_copied):\n            cnt += 1\nprint(cnt)"
